# exp59 artifact hygiene — mirrors the exp58 hardened-writer policy.
# Keep curated top-level notes/schema/aggregates trackable; ignore build/raw run/log artifacts.

# build outputs
build/
*.so
*.o
*.dylib
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# raw run artifacts (per-run scratch, ignored)
_ray_runs/

# raw logs (Ray session logs, HPX parcel logs, etc.)
*.log
hpx.parcel.*.log
logs/
ray_session*/

# raw run index stays ignored
ray_index.jsonl

# Aggregate-write policy (mirror of exp58 safe_write_aggregate; see ray_actor_vs_hpx_action_path.md):
#   TRACKABLE curated PASS aggregates (written only by a pass; never end in _skip/_fail/_redirected):
#     - ray_actor_same_host_aggregate.json            (Slice 1 same-host control)
#     - ray_actor_two_node_placement_aggregate.json   (Slice 2 two-node placement proof)
#     - ray_actor_aggregate.json             (later)
#     - hpx_reference_aggregate.json         (later)
#     - comparison_aggregate.json            (later)
#   IGNORED non-curated aggregates (skip/fail + redirected run-id siblings):
*aggregate*_skip.json
*aggregate*_fail.json
*aggregate*local_skip.json
*aggregate*_other.json
# run-id redirect siblings from the overwrite guard
*aggregate*_redirected_*.json
